  "_": "office's look for iTerm2. Optional, exactly like theme/office-theme.tmux.conf: install.sh only merges this into the 'office' profile when you pass --theme, and keys starting with _ are stripped. Appearance only, so your font, your shell and your key mappings are untouched. Monochrome by conviction: state is tone, weight and inversion, never hue, and #C9903F is the one accent, meaning 'this needs you'. Transparency 0.15 with a blur radius of 12 is the setting this was tuned at; it is one number, change it to taste. To take the colours but not the glass, delete the Transparency, Blur and Blur Radius keys.",
